; https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/master/pages/common/jj-operation-restore.md

% jj-operation-restore, common

# Restore the repository state at a specific operation
jj <_op_operation_> restore <operation_id>

# Restore only the repository state and local bookmarks (ignoring remote-tracking bookmarks)
jj <_op_operation_> restore --what repo <operation_id>
